                                                "sense_id": "a1fb9af6-220a-3b3c-a75b-991f0cf42f5b",
                                                "text": "Their croppings are either entirely barren or contain only a moderate amount of copper, but much richer ore is ordinarily found just above the chalcocite zone."
                                            },
